START

Choose an already existing product
Input the amount of units sold for the product
Check if the product exists and has enough stock

WHILE the product exists and has enough stock
  take the existing stock amount and subtract it from the sales amount
  Calculate the remaining stock
  Save the remaining stock

IF there is not enough stock
  Deny the request due to a lack of stock
ELSE the product does not exist
  Deny the request due to a nonexistent product

END
